      ]
    }
  ],
  "kind": "event",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "p9-social-tenement-neighbors.stove-and-line",
      "title": "星期一早晨的炉子与晾衣绳",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0432,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 18,
          "max": 80
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "home"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "householdSize",
          "min": 2
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        },
        {
          "key": "neighborB",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "stove-and-line.first-come-order",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把四只洗衣盆按到厨房的先后排成一列，用粉笔在门后写下各家的时辰：六点到七点半、七点半到九点。{neighbor}起初嘟囔，看到自家名字排在第二格，也就把水壶提了回去。晾衣绳按同样次序分两段，谁家的床单先上谁先占。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.04,
              "reason": "把厨房和晾衣绳的次序说清，早晨不再堵在门口"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "obligation": 0.03,
              "reason": "共同定下用炉和晾衣的次序"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "stove-and-line.first-come-order",
              "text": "粉笔字写得歪，{neighborB}凑近念了一遍，说自家的名字写小了一号。{subject}拿抹布擦掉重写，阁楼上的绳子这一回没人再偷偷挪动。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "stove-and-line.first-come-order",
              "text": "楼梯间的煤气味混着肥皂水味。{subject}把盆沿擦干，顺手把三楼的湿床单往回折了一掌宽，给后面的人让出一段绳子。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "stove-and-line.move-to-line-end",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把自己泡着的衣服端到绳子最末一段，把靠近炉子的位置让给{neighbor}，条件是对方看着火，别让水烧干。{neighbor}点头，往炉膛里添了一块煤，说中午以前一定把炉子空出来。两家的盆就挨着放在窗下。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.08,
              "obligation": 0.05,
              "reason": "让出炉位换人看火"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "早晨的争抢化成一句说定的托付"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "stove-and-line.move-to-line-end",
              "text": "绳尾风大，衣服干得慢些。{subject}用木夹把袖口夹紧，回头看见{neighbor}正把自家水壶从炉上提开，腾出炉圈。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "stove-and-line.move-to-line-end",
              "text": "炉门一开，热气扑到脸上。{neighbor}说十一点前不会走开，{subject}便把最后一只盆也搬了过去，绳子上的水珠滴在石板地上。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "stove-and-line.sheet-quarrel",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}发现自己搭在栏杆上的床单被人挪到了绳尾，角上沾了煤灰，一时火起，在楼梯间拦住{neighbor}问是谁动的。{neighbor}说是{neighborB}嫌滴水，两人越说越响，最后各自回屋摔上门，炉子空着，谁也没再去烧水。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "为一条被挪动的床单吵了一场"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.07,
              "reason": "床单被挪动引发的争吵"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "stove-and-line.sheet-quarrel",
              "text": "床单一角的黑印怎么也搓不掉。{subject}把它重新搭好，听见隔壁门闩落下，楼道里只剩下滴水声。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "stove-and-line.sheet-quarrel",
              "text": "{neighborB}站在半层楼梯上没作声，手里拎着空桶。{subject}回到厨房，炉膛已经凉了，早晨那点热水也白烧了。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-tenement-neighbors.rent-note",
      "title": "看门人送来的涨租纸条",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0432,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 18,
          "max": 80
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "home"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cash",
          "max": 50
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 25,
          "maxAge": 80
        },
        {
          "key": "official",
          "kind": "official",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 30,
          "maxAge": 65
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "rent-note.pay-increase",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把纸条压在糖罐下面，算了半天：两克朗正好是四天的面包钱。月底还是把涨后的房租数出来交给看门人，铜币在桌上摞成两小堆。那一周的晚饭改成面包和稀汤，猪油省着抹。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -2,
              "reason": "按涨租纸条多付的两克朗"
            },
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "从伙食里挤出涨租的钱"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "rent-note.pay-increase",
              "text": "看门人点数时手指沾了唾沫。{subject}看着最后一枚赫勒被推过去，把收条折好塞进围裙口袋，楼道的玻璃窗果然换过了。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "rent-note.pay-increase",
              "text": "糖罐里只剩下一点碎糖。{subject}把纸条留在罐底，提醒自己下个月还要再数一遍，厨房的汤锅比往常清。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rent-note.together-to-office",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}和{neighbor}叫上楼下两家，一同去房东的事务所。{official}隔着柜台听他们说完，翻出账簿，答应先补上楼梯间的窗闩，涨租从下下个月起算。四人出门时挤在台阶上，谁也没先说话，{neighbor}把帽子往后一推，说总算没白跑。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.09,
              "obligation": 0.04,
              "reason": "一同去事务所交涉涨租"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.05,
              "reason": "几家联手把涨租推迟了一个月"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "rent-note.together-to-office",
              "text": "事务所的墨水味很重。{official}把印章在印泥上按了两下，说窗闩这周就派人来装，{subject}盯着那张写满名字的纸，直到它被夹进账簿。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "rent-note.together-to-office",
              "text": "回程经过面包店，{neighbor}买了四个小面包分给同去的人。{subject}边走边吃，纸袋上的油印沾到手指。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rent-note.look-for-cheaper-bed",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}没去事务所，只在洗衣房打听更便宜的床位。有人提到利奥波德城另一条街上有一间合住的屋子，一个月少一克朗半，只是要跟三个人共用一间。{subject}去看了两趟，量了窗子和床的位置，回来把箱子底下的旧报纸铺开算账。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "flag": "looking_for_cheaper_housing",
              "add": true,
              "reason": "开始打听更便宜的床位"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.03,
              "reason": "向同楼邻居打听租房消息"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "rent-note.look-for-cheaper-bed",
              "text": "那间屋子朝后院，墙上渗着潮气。{subject}蹲下摸了摸床板，回来时在楼梯间同{neighbor}说了一声，对方只问新住处的看门人凶不凶。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "rent-note.look-for-cheaper-bed",
              "text": "旧报纸上写满了数。{subject}把省下的一克朗半在纸上圈了两圈，又把行李清单添了一项，窗外的晾衣绳还搭着别人的床单。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-tenement-neighbors.gramophone-wall",
      "title": "院子上空的留声机",
      "weight": 0.9,
      "rate": 0.0384,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 18,
          "max": 80
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "home"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "gramophone-wall.knock-and-bargain",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}上楼敲了{neighbor}的门，说唱针刮在墙上，夜班的人睡不安稳。{neighbor}把留声机从墙边挪到窗下，垫了一块毛毡，答应十点以后不再放。下楼时进行曲还在响，但闷了些，{subject}能听见自家水壶的响声了。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "reason": "商量留声机挪位和静音时辰"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "夜里终于能早些入睡"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "gramophone-wall.knock-and-bargain",
              "text": "门开时唱片还在转。{neighbor}弯腰把机器挪开，毛毡边角翘起来，{subject}伸手按平，顺手把唱针抬了一下。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "gramophone-wall.knock-and-bargain",
              "text": "楼梯间的灯只剩半截芯。{subject}一边下楼一边听，进行曲隔着窗子传出来，像蒙了一层布。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "gramophone-wall.caretaker-notice",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}去找看门人，说院子里四面墙，声音绕不出去。第二天楼梯间的木板上贴了一张纸：晚上十点后请勿放留声机，鞋匠铺也请收锤。纸条没有落款，只有房东事务所的戳。{neighbor}路过时看了很久，把留声机的盖子合上了。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.04,
              "reason": "楼梯间贴出了作息告示"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.03,
              "reason": "请看门人出面，而不是当面商量"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "gramophone-wall.caretaker-notice",
              "text": "纸上写着“请勿”，字迹规整。{subject}看见{neighbor}在板前停下，用手抹了一下纸角，又把手放回口袋。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "gramophone-wall.caretaker-notice",
              "text": "鞋匠第二天果然收了锤，院子里安静得能听见鸽子落在窗台。可{subject}再上楼时，{neighbor}只点了一下头。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "gramophone-wall.cotton-in-ears",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}忍到天亮，第二天去药房买了五分钱的棉花，撕成两小团塞在耳里。夜里的进行曲还剩一点闷响，翻个身也就过去了。此后在楼梯间遇见{neighbor}只是点头，再没有进过那家的门。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "cash",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "在药房买棉花塞耳朵"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.05,
              "reason": "不开口交涉，只是疏远"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "gramophone-wall.cotton-in-ears",
              "text": "棉花塞进去，自己的呼吸声一下变大了。{subject}把剩下的一小卷放进抽屉，和针线摆在一起。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "gramophone-wall.cotton-in-ears",
              "text": "第二天清早，院子的石板路上落着唱片封套的碎纸。{subject}扫自己门前时把它们拢到墙角，没多看一眼。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-social-tenement-neighbors.flour-loan",
      "title": "借出去的一袋面粉",
      "weight": 0.9,
      "rate": 0.0384,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 18,
          "max": 80
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "home"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "cash",
          "max": 40
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 18,
          "maxAge": 80
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "flour-loan.full-bag",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把一整袋面粉倒进{neighbor}的空口袋，袋口用麻绳扎了两道，说等她男人发了薪再还。{neighbor}连声道谢，把写着借煤日期的小纸片折好放回围裙。柜子里只剩一袋面粉，{subject}当晚煮汤时多加了一勺水。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -2,
              "reason": "借出的一整袋面粉"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "obligation": 0.06,
              "reason": "借出面粉救急"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "flour-loan.full-bag",
              "text": "面粉扬起一层白雾。{neighbor}把口袋抱在胸前，出门前回头说发薪那天一准先送过来。{subject}点点头，把柜门关严。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "flour-loan.full-bag",
              "text": "麻绳打得紧，{neighbor}试了试袋口的结实程度。{subject}把空面袋抖干净，挂在厨房钉子上，想着下个月得少做两回面疙瘩。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "flour-loan.half-bag-with-note",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}只舀出半袋，说自家也不宽裕，要{neighbor}把上次的煤钱一并记在纸上。{neighbor}接过纸片，当着面把日期和数目重写一遍，两人各留一半。面粉少了，账却清楚了，{subject}把纸片夹进账簿样的旧本子。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "借出的半袋面粉"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.04,
              "obligation": 0.09,
              "reason": "借半袋并立下字据"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "flour-loan.half-bag-with-note",
              "text": "铅笔头在纸片上蹭了两下才出字。{neighbor}念了一遍数目，问要不要画个押。{subject}说不用，把旧本子的夹页掀开，把纸片插平。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
